<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vanguard Cellular.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vanguard Cellular.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Kurt Abkemeier downgraded Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc to market performer from buy after the stock reached his $15 year-end price target.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/4 to 15-1/8.</p>
</text>
